items.DR_Death_Veil.description = Beneath this ragged midnight cowl, a pale mask keeps its final vigil. Its hollow gaze recalls the Horseman who walked beyond the grave and returned with the silence of kingdoms.\n\n+18 Health, +30 Mana. Physical/Projectile resistance: 9%; Void resistance: 8%.\nPrimary Necromancer affinity: +5% Sorcery, +3 Flow. Advanced Necromancer paths qualify. Bonuses require this piece to be equipped and unbroken.
items.DR_Death_Veil.name = Death's Veil
items.DR_Harbinger_Scythe.description = A crescent of blackened mithril carries the skulls of those who bargained with the last Horseman. Their silent mouths drink the final warmth from every wound and return it as power to the hand that reaps. Death does not hurry. His tithe always comes due.\n\nPrimary: alternating 3.5-block soul sweeps; 84 Physical base damage with a 0.52-second base swing cycle, +1.5 Mana and +1 signature charge on hit. Secondary: stamina guard. Q - The Final Tithe: spend all 12 charges and 12 Mana for a committed heavy sweep dealing 370 Physical base damage with a 1.01-second windup and 1.4-second total action; steals 8 Health from every enemy hit with no multi-target falloff. Also restores Mana on hit (8 initially, reduced for additional targets). Lifesteal cannot exceed maximum Health. Native resistances, parries and skill scaling apply.
items.DR_Harbinger_Scythe.name = Harbinger of the Pale Rider
items.DR_Harvester_Grasp.description = These burial-bound gauntlets close with the certainty of a final breath. Bone knuckles cradle the haft of the Harbinger, lending flesh and sorcery to the work of the Pale Rider.\n\n+16 Health, +15 Mana. Physical/Projectile resistance: 7%; Void resistance: 4%.\nPrimary Necromancer affinity: +4% Strength, +4% Sorcery. Advanced Necromancer paths qualify. Bonuses require this piece to be equipped and unbroken.
items.DR_Harvester_Grasp.name = Harvester's Grasp
items.DR_Pale_Rider_Strides.description = Tattered funeral cloth trails behind greaves that have crossed the Dead Kingdom without leaving a footprint. Every measured step carries their wearer closer to the next soul's appointed hour.\n\n+26 Health, +3 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 13%; Void resistance: 6%.\nPrimary Necromancer affinity: +3 Flow, +3% Haste. Advanced Necromancer paths qualify. Bonuses require this piece to be equipped and unbroken.
items.DR_Pale_Rider_Strides.name = Pale Rider's Strides
items.DR_Reaper_Mantle.description = A cage of ancient ribs rises into the broken wings of a deathless reaper. Verdigris iron and funerary bronze bind its spectral heart; the living hear a heartbeat where no heart remains.\n\n+36 Health, +25 Mana. Physical/Projectile resistance: 16%; Void resistance: 12%.\nPrimary Necromancer affinity: +4% Sorcery, +4 Life Force. Advanced Necromancer paths qualify. Bonuses require this piece to be equipped and unbroken.
items.DR_Reaper_Mantle.name = Mantle of the Reaper
